  "body": "If a script-blocking <style> element has critical subresources, we should increment the [script-blocking stylesheet counter](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#script-blocking-style-sheet-counter) when we start to fetch those subresources, and decrement the counter when the fetching finishes.\r\n\r\nThe decrement step is at [here](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-style-element:script-blocking-style-sheet-counter-2), but the increment step seems missing, as none of the references of script-blocking stylesheet counter is related.",
